% =====================================================================
%  beamerthemecolorbeam.sty
%  colorbeam: a calm but friendly Beamer theme for university lectures
%  and lab sessions (16:9), with a multi-color section system, callout
%  boxes, code blocks, numbered steps and TikZ helpers. Subject-specific
%  extras (programming, electronics) are optional libraries.
%
%  Home: https://github.com/eskander/colorbeam
%
%  Compile with XeLaTeX or LuaLaTeX (fontspec is required):
%     \documentclass[aspectratio=169,12pt,t]{beamer}
%     \usetheme{colorbeam}
%     \usecolorbeamlibrary{programming,electronics}   % optional
% =====================================================================
